  "statement": "Sustainability is critical in the RollCall system. GRN-01 aims to minimize energy consumption, aligning with modern practices for responsible resource use. GRN-02 emphasizes the use of energy-efficient cloud storage, reducing the carbon footprint of data handling. GRN-03 ensures low-energy communication for real-time updates, crucial for maintaining efficient operations. GRN-04 promotes resource-efficient report generation, while GRN-05 educates users on their carbon footprint. GRN-06 aligns data retention with sustainable practices, and GRN-07 optimizes the interface for low-power devices. However, there are potential conflicts with EfficiencyAgent's EFF-06, as load balancing may increase energy use, and with SafetyAgent's SAF-03, as automated alerts could lead to increased energy consumption.",
